[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780728838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105012#issuecomment-2780728838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012","id":2780728838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lvo4G","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T13:38:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T13:38:12Z","body":"This seems to be expected behavior. UASTC (and BPTC/ASTC it transcodes to) always includes alpha. The large file size is because Godot's BasisU packer doesn't enable zstd and rdo compression, which also results in large BasisU PortableCompressedTexture2D.\n\nI hope there can be options to configure BasisU's compression. Anyway, the current description about BasisU https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html is incorrect.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780728838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused