":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781006912","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105012#issuecomment-2781006912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012","id":2781006912,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwsxA","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T17:30:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T17:30:25Z","body":"Yes, #104571 can compress the imported textures, but it does not affect PortableCompressedTexture2D (though it's possible to implement equivalent functionality for it).\n\nBasisU has built-in compression functionality, which may perform better than directly compressing the data. I don't know why it's not enabled.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781006912/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781051019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105012#issuecomment-2781051019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012","id":2781051019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lw3iL","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T19:19:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T19:19:47Z","body":"If I remember correctly, that functionality is reserved to saving the textures as .ktx, while Godot saves the data as .basis","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781051019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781054150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105012#issuecomment-2781054150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012","id":2781054150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lw4TG"